<%- include('../partials/head', { title, csrfToken }) %>
<main class="marketing-shell">
  <section class="marketing-hero">
    <div class="marketing-nav">
      <a class="marketing-brand" href="/">
        <span class="marketing-brand__mark">AI</span>
        <span><%= appName %></span>
      </a>
      <div class="marketing-nav__actions">
        <a class="btn btn-outline-dark" href="/login">Login</a>
        <a class="btn btn-warning" href="/register">Coba Gratis</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="marketing-hero__content">
      <div class="marketing-hero__copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Built for Indonesia creator economy</span>
        <h1>Ubah video panjang jadi short clip siap upload dalam workflow yang rapi.</h1>
        <p>
          Creator Studio AI membantu tim creator, agency, podcaster, dan UMKM memotong video panjang menjadi clip
          vertikal dengan analisis hook, ranking viral score, subtitle, workflow review, dan render pipeline yang bisa
          diandalkan.
        </p>
        <div class="marketing-hero__cta">
          <a class="btn btn-warning btn-lg" href="/register">Mulai Workspace</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline-dark btn-lg" href="/login">Masuk ke Dashboard</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="marketing-points">
          <li>Analisis kandidat clip dari video panjang</li>
          <li>Progress job yang transparan dan durable</li>
          <li>Review hasil clipping sebelum publish</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="marketing-hero__preview">
        <div class="marketing-preview-card">
          <div class="marketing-preview-card__label">Auto Clipping Workflow</div>
          <h2>Pipeline creator yang fokus ke hasil, bukan chaos file.</h2>
          <div class="marketing-preview-progress">
            <span>Transcription</span>
            <div class="progress progress-lg"><div class="progress-bar bg-success" style="width: 100%"></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="marketing-preview-progress">
            <span>Candidate Ranking</span>
            <div class="progress progress-lg"><div class="progress-bar bg-warning" style="width: 82%"></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="marketing-preview-progress">
            <span>Render Output</span>
            <div class="progress progress-lg"><div class="progress-bar" style="width: 68%"></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="marketing-preview-metrics">
            <article><strong>10</strong><span>Kandidat clip</span></article>
            <article><strong>5</strong><span>Best clip siap review</span></article>
            <article><strong>9:16</strong><span>Siap Shorts/Reels/TikTok</span></article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="marketing-section">
    <div class="marketing-section__header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Kenapa Creator Studio AI</span>
      <h2>Bukan cuma upload video, tapi workspace clipping end-to-end.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="marketing-grid">
      <article class="marketing-card">
        <h3>Analisis clip yang lebih editorial</h3>
        <p>Cari momen hook, konflik, insight, dan payoff yang paling layak dijadikan short-form content.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="marketing-card">
        <h3>Job progress yang jelas</h3>
        <p>Lihat status per tahap, event log, retry, dan review output tanpa kehilangan jejak proses.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="marketing-card">
        <h3>Siap untuk tim creator</h3>
        <p>Enak untuk workflow creator solo, editor, agency, sampai admin internal yang butuh kontrol operasional.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="marketing-section marketing-section--alt">
    <div class="marketing-section__header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Use Cases</span>
      <h2>Cocok untuk konten edukasi, podcast, bisnis, politik, sampai personal brand.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="marketing-grid marketing-grid--wide">
      <article class="marketing-card">
        <h3>Podcast & wawancara</h3>
        <p>Temukan jawaban paling tajam, debat paling menarik, dan momen yang bikin orang berhenti scroll.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="marketing-card">
        <h3>Konten edukasi & bisnis</h3>
        <p>Potong insight yang padat, bisa berdiri sendiri, dan punya CTA kuat untuk komentar atau save.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="marketing-card">
        <h3>Agency & media team</h3>
        <p>Workflow clipping yang lebih rapi untuk review, retry, dan scaling produksi clip harian.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="marketing-card">
        <h3>UMKM & creator Indonesia</h3>
        <p>Bikin proses repurpose konten panjang jadi lebih cepat tanpa kehilangan rasa editorial.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
